of medium and large scale industries. At the same time, these tasks require practiced and skilled professionals so that work is up to the quality standards. Our objective is “Increased productivity with Reduced Cost while maintaining efficiency and Quality Standards.”</p>\n\t\t\t\t \t</div>\n                  \t<div class=\"why-cont\">\n                    \t <h2>Why VIVA ?</h2>\n                           <p>Our services are not just restricted to establishments like shopping malls, hotels, Corporate and offices; VIVA also provides its services for events and exhibitions of any kind.</p>\n                           <p>At VIVA we believe in maintaining high standards of quality and service. For us quality is more important than quantity and that is the reason why we do not take to many assignments at one time, whatever assignments we take receive our complete attention and focus. For VIVA quality of service and client satisfaction always comes first. </p>\n                          <p>The company has kept itself updated on ever changing needs of establishments and provides cost effective solutions to its clients.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"why-cont\">\n                    \t<h2>Why Only VIVA ?</h2>\n                        <p>Priority status to our valued clients by paying more attention which already grown security organization can not provide.</p>\n                        \n                        <h4>3 Tier Training Program</h4>\n                        <ul class=\"abt-list\">\n                        \t<li><i class=\"fa fa-shield\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Basic Guarding Training</li>\n                            <li><i class=\"fa fa-shield\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Industry specific Training</li>\n                            <li><i class=\"fa fa-shield\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Site specific Training</li>\n                        </ul>\n                        \n                         <h4>On-the-Job (OJT) Training : </h4>\n                        <ul class=\"abt-list\">\n                        \t<li><i class=\"fa fa-shield\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Regular On-site & off-site training to update security skills; impart site-specific changes in security procedures; improve skill levels; refresh security skills; etc. </li>\n                            <li><i class=\"fa fa-shield\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Optional training to client’s staff of security.</li>\n                            <li><i class=\"fa fa-shield\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Security Survey of site by VIVA professional team.</li>\n                             <li><i class=\"fa fa-shield\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Regular Security audit by VIVA professional team to recommend change for improved security.</li>\n                        </ul>\n                        \n                         <h4>Regular visit for monitoring of site : </h4>\n                        <ul class=\"abt-list\">\n                        \t<li><i class=\"fa fa-shield\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Surprise night checks (twice-weekly) by Area-Managers Regular site visits by Area Manager; </li>\n                            <li><i class=\"fa fa-shield\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Branch Head.Visit by Marketing Dept. </li>\n                            <li><i class=\"fa fa-shield\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Escalation matrix provided with all contact details.</li>\n                            <li><i class=\"fa fa-shield\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Monthly review meeting with clients to solve the security related issues/ difficulties.</li>\n                            <li><i class=\"fa fa-shield\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Regular interaction by Marketing Dept for independent feedback.</li>\n                            <li><i class=\"fa fa-shield\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> 24X7 accessibility at all levels within VIVA. </li>\n                            <li><i class=\"fa fa-shield\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Non-unionized & motivated workforce. <